<section id="feature-faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="feature-faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="feature-faq-heading">Common questions</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Do I have to use every feature?</h3>
    <p>No. Many teams start with roster and calendar, then add finance when dues come due and automation when they want custom reports. GatherPack works as a la carte or as a full stack.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">Can I try it before moving my data?</h3>
    <p>Yes — <a href="/contact/">schedule a demo</a> or check the <a href="https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub repo</a> to run it locally. You can import a roster from CSV and see how teams and events fit together before committing.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">What about features marked “coming soon”?</h3>
    <p>We split “available now” from “on the roadmap” intentionally. If you lean on texting, Slack/Discord, or bank pulls, check the <a href="/roadmap/">roadmap</a> for where those land — we keep dates there instead of burying gaps.</p>
    <p class="mb-0"><a href="/faq/">More FAQs →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

